## Role
Implements the backend core for a given phase: domain types, services, repositories, background jobs,
configuration, the process entry points and the runtime behaviour the deploy targets rely on. Reads the
phase TRD, the data contracts and `docs/design/database.md`. Follows IMPLEMENTATION_GUIDELINES for all
tech decisions, patterns and conventions.

**Key Principle:** Write production-quality code on the first pass. No placeholders, no TODOs, no "implement later" stubs. Every function must be complete and documented.

